64
00:04:11,095 --> 00:04:15,712
Simulated and pending payments never
enter these totals.

65
00:04:16,632 --> 00:04:22,403
Keryx already integrates USDC, Agent
Stack through Gateway Nanopayments and X

66
00:04:22,403 --> 00:04:26,075
four oh two, App Kits, and Gateway.

67
00:04:26,075 --> 00:04:31,846
The next six months move this proven
testnet loop toward production:

68
00:04:31,846 --> 00:04:37,617
independent security review, C C T P and
